'''Senator Chuchi's apartment''' was a apartment belonging to [[Senator]] [[Riyo Chuchi]] of [[Pantora]] that was located in [[Imperial City]] on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. It was guarded by [[Pantoran]] [[Pantoran guard|guards]] and featured a large reception area and a living room.<ref name="TC" /> In [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|208}}</ref> Chuchi hosted a meeting with fellow Senator [[Halle Burtoni]] of [[Kamino]] in her apartment to discuss about the suspicious mishandling of the [[Defense Finance Committee]] funds by [[Vice Admiral]] [[Edmon Rampart]]; Burtoni eventually confirmed Chuchi's suspicions and agreed to testify of the matter before the [[Imperial Senate]], leading to Rampart's arrest.<ref name="TC" />

